{
    "version": "0.1.3921",
    "description": "Unified model, provider, and gateway manager for AI coding agents. (rolling release, tracks GitHub latest)",
    "homepage": "https://usemagpie.ai",
    "license": "MIT",
    "notes": [
        "Tracks the latest GitHub releases of Magpie (rolling channel), auto-updated by CI every 6 hours.",
        "To update: exit Magpie (tray - Quit) first, then run 'scoop update' followed by 'scoop update magpie-ai'. Scoop silently skips update/uninstall while Magpie is running.",
        "In-app auto update is preset off via data/settings.json (only when it doesn't already exist; existing settings are kept as-is).",
        "scoop uninstall won't remove external integration (Open at login, magpie:// handler, user PATH entry from Settings - Command line). Use in-app Settings - Uninstall magpie to clean up, or 'magpie uninstall --keep-data' to keep settings."
    ],
    "suggest": {
        "WebView2": "extras/webview2"
    },
